WEBVTT

00:09:30.274 --> 00:09:33.611
Today, can you live
without your smartphone?

00:09:33.986 --> 00:09:35.738
I assume not, right?

00:09:36.488 --> 00:09:37.990
In a few years from now,

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:43.203
your smart assistant will be a convenient,

00:09:43.245 --> 00:09:46.248
powerful, reliable helper

00:09:46.248 --> 00:09:49.835
essential in your day-to-day life.

00:09:49.835 --> 00:09:52.212
So you won't be able to live without it.

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:55.090
And unlike your smartphones,

00:09:55.132 --> 00:09:58.510
it will be embedded
in every device around you.

00:09:58.552 --> 00:10:00.471
Your smartphone itself, of course,